{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Let's begin the briefing Agent, I\u2019m only saying this once, so pay attention.\u00a0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3437820/extras/3a244d3c2b4c1e958dae96fe07effc85.avif?t=1758426824\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3437820/extras_big/3a244d3c2b4c1e958dae96fe07effc85.avif?t=1758426824 width=800 height=125 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your role? Sounds simple on paper. You show up after a hit, and you erase every trace\u2014every drop, every fingerprint, every clue. The scene must look untouched. No evidence. No questions. No loose ends.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019ll be scrubbing down entire crime scenes. You\u2019ll bag bodies, dispose of trash, and clean up every mess. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you progress, you'll <strong>unlock better tools and upgrade your skills</strong>\u2014but don't get cocky. If you can\u2019t handle the basics, none of it will save you. We\u2019re judged on results, not effort.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3437820/extras/04846fb69e999220f588b899cf2a194e.avif?t=1758426824\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3437820/extras_big/04846fb69e999220f588b899cf2a194e.avif?t=1758426824 width=800 height=125 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Here\u2019s the part that gets sticky: <strong>You\u2019re deep undercover.</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your mission: Infiltrate the\u00a0<strong>Syndicate</strong>, a brutal underground organization led by the infamous hitman <strong>Victor Kane</strong>\u2014a man responsible for Hundreds of kills, most of which were never supposed to be possible. The Syndicate doesn\u2019t tolerate failure. And they definitely don\u2019t tolerate rats.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3437820/extras/aff2b80591d3705f1a483d075f5aef43.avif?t=1758426824\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3437820/extras_big/aff2b80591d3705f1a483d075f5aef43.avif?t=1758426824 width=800 height=125 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each scene is more than blood and bodies.<br>You'll find journals, voice recordings, broken phones, newspaper clippings, even symbols and markings. Some of it won\u2019t make sense. Some of it will make <i>too much</i> sense.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The syndicate\u2019s hiding something bigger. Something old. Something that watches from the shadows. I\u2019d tell you more, but I like you alive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3437820/extras/6e8e93b92a2ae3c4b342c08b5f237624.avif?t=1758426824\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3437820/extras_big/6e8e93b92a2ae3c4b342c08b5f237624.avif?t=1758426824 width=800 height=125 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This isn\u2019t your average cleanup job.<br>There are whispers in the dark. Strange figures. Places that shouldn\u2019t exist. The fear? It\u2019s real. And if you\u2019re hearing voices\u2026 don\u2019t panic. You're not the only one.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every scare, every sound, every piece of evidence\u2014it all connects. This isn\u2019t random. There\u2019s a truth buried in the filth, and it\u2019s clawing its way out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3437820/extras/66e9254d490877b7711fe0c47d10b91f.avif?t=1758426824\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3437820/extras_big/66e9254d490877b7711fe0c47d10b91f.avif?t=1758426824 width=800 height=125 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Think this is just about cleaning? Think again.<br>You're unraveling a web of assassinations, missing agents, weird rituals, and a secret war that\u2019s been going on for decades. And somehow\u2026 all of it leads back to <strong>Victor Kane</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once you step into the crime scenes\u2026 the real horror begins.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >So that\u2019s your briefing. Welcome to the undercover world Agent. <br>Keep your head down, your tools ready, and your eyes open. And whatever you do\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Don\u2019t trust anyone!&quot;</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3437820/extras/14a7835bbf7376cc3e68cdbcc15c04ec.avif?t=1758426824\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3437820/extras_big/14a7835bbf7376cc3e68cdbcc15c04ec.avif?t=1758426824 width=800 height=224 /></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3437820?t=1758426824","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3437820?t=1758426824","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3437820/5908c41f5efe5c99b7aaa63878c41d6ae2eaaab5/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1758426824","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3437820/5908c41f5efe5c99b7aaa63878c41d6ae2eaaab5/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1758426824","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"VR Only","id":54},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"Wiped Clean contains depictions of violent crime scenes with unsettling imagery, including blood and murder evidence. The storyline involves criminal activity, and an exploration of corruption. Sensitive topics such as betrayal, violence are part of the narrative. \r\n\r\nThere are NO depictions of sexual assault/non-consensual sex, BDSM, drug/alcohol abuse.. Viewer discretion is advised."},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Let's begin the briefing Agent, I\u2019m only saying this once, so pay attention.\u00a0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3437820/extras/3a244d3c2b4c1e958dae96fe07effc85.avif?t=1758426824\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3437820/extras_big/3a244d3c2b4c1e958dae96fe07effc85.avif?t=1758426824 width=800 height=125 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your role? Sounds simple on paper. You show up after a hit, and you erase every trace\u2014every drop, every fingerprint, every clue. The scene must look untouched. No evidence. No questions. No loose ends.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019ll be scrubbing down entire crime scenes. You\u2019ll bag bodies, dispose of trash, and clean up every mess. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you progress, you'll <strong>unlock better tools and upgrade your skills</strong>\u2014but don't get cocky. If you can\u2019t handle the basics, none of it will save you. We\u2019re judged on results, not effort.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3437820/extras/04846fb69e999220f588b899cf2a194e.avif?t=1758426824\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3437820/extras_big/04846fb69e999220f588b899cf2a194e.avif?t=1758426824 width=800 height=125 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Here\u2019s the part that gets sticky: <strong>You\u2019re deep undercover.</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your mission: Infiltrate the\u00a0<strong>Syndicate</strong>, a brutal underground organization led by the infamous hitman <strong>Victor Kane</strong>\u2014a man responsible for Hundreds of kills, most of which were never supposed to be possible. The Syndicate doesn\u2019t tolerate failure. And they definitely don\u2019t tolerate rats.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3437820/extras/aff2b80591d3705f1a483d075f5aef43.avif?t=1758426824\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3437820/extras_big/aff2b80591d3705f1a483d075f5aef43.avif?t=1758426824 width=800 height=125 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each scene is more than blood and bodies.<br>You'll find journals, voice recordings, broken phones, newspaper clippings, even symbols and markings. Some of it won\u2019t make sense. Some of it will make <i>too much</i> sense.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The syndicate\u2019s hiding something bigger. Something old. Something that watches from the shadows. I\u2019d tell you more, but I like you alive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3437820/extras/6e8e93b92a2ae3c4b342c08b5f237624.avif?t=1758426824\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3437820/extras_big/6e8e93b92a2ae3c4b342c08b5f237624.avif?t=1758426824 width=800 height=125 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This isn\u2019t your average cleanup job.<br>There are whispers in the dark. Strange figures. Places that shouldn\u2019t exist. The fear? It\u2019s real. And if you\u2019re hearing voices\u2026 don\u2019t panic. You're not the only one.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every scare, every sound, every piece of evidence\u2014it all connects. This isn\u2019t random. There\u2019s a truth buried in the filth, and it\u2019s clawing its way out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3437820/extras/66e9254d490877b7711fe0c47d10b91f.avif?t=1758426824\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3437820/extras_big/66e9254d490877b7711fe0c47d10b91f.avif?t=1758426824 width=800 height=125 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Think this is just about cleaning? Think again.<br>You're unraveling a web of assassinations, missing agents, weird rituals, and a secret war that\u2019s been going on for decades. And somehow\u2026 all of it leads back to <strong>Victor Kane</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once you step into the crime scenes\u2026 the real horror begins.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >So that\u2019s your briefing. Welcome to the undercover world Agent. <br>Keep your head down, your tools ready, and your eyes open. And whatever you do\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Don\u2019t trust anyone!&quot;</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3437820/extras/14a7835bbf7376cc3e68cdbcc15c04ec.avif?t=1758426824\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3437820/extras_big/14a7835bbf7376cc3e68cdbcc15c04ec.avif?t=1758426824 width=800 height=224 /></span></p>","developers":["Luminary Creations"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3437820/0ea0a84336b34d1b38dc5952c1f3e2f276625e63/header.jpg?t=1758426824","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movi